{"type":"META","ticket":402373,"id":"META"}||{"title":"TPSI3052QDWZRQ1","tags":["电源管理","隔离式栅极驱动器"],"source":"dc2a50eaab274c81a2c06a7c6abe2518|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","images":["https://alimg.szlcsc.com/upload/public/product/middle/20240224/188F71924C2796A8D08AA1319EE10840.jpg"],"attributes":{"LCSC Part Name":"汽车增强型隔离式开关驱动器，集成15V栅极电源","Supplier Part":"C17435523","Manufacturer":"TI(德州仪器)","Manufacturer Part":"TPSI3052QDWZRQ1","Supplier Footprint":"SOIC-8","JLCPCB Part Class":"Extended Part","Datasheet":"https://item.szlcsc.com/datasheet/TPSI3052QDWZRQ1/18564716.html","Supplier":"LCSC","Add into BOM":"yes","Convert to PCB":"yes","Symbol":"8266a274f3e0132f","Designator":"U?","Footprint":"581f583318e44f39","3D Model":"242fac49d3bf4059989cd1faaadd5b1a|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","3D Model Title":"SOIC-8_L7.5-W5.9-P1.27-LS11.5-BL-1","3D Model Transform":"229.921,452.755,0,0,0,0,0.001,0,0","Driven Configuration":"-","Isolation voltage(Vrms)":"5000V","Load Type":"MOSFET、IGBT","Number of Channels":"1","Voltage - Supply (Input)":"6.5V~48V；3V~5.5V","Peak Output Current(source)":"1.5A","Peak Output Current(sink)":"3A","Operating Temperature":"-40℃~+125℃","Rise Time":"6ns","Fall Time":"5ns","Propagation Delay tpLH":"4.5us；185us","Propagation Delay tpHL":"3us","Input Logic Level - High":"2.1V~3.85V；2.1V~3.85V","Input Logic Level - Low":"0V~1.65V；0V~2V","Quiescent Current(Iq)":"-","CMTI(kV/us)":"100kV/us","Voltage - Supply (Driver)":"13.9V~16.2V","Features":"-","Name":"={Manufacturer Part}","Description":"是一个完全集成的隔离式开关驱动器，与外部功率开关结合，可形成一个完整的隔离式固态继电器 (SSR)。具有 15V 的标称栅极驱动电压，1.5/3.0A 的峰值源电流和灌电流，可选择多种外部功率开关以满足广泛的应用需求。从初级侧接收的功率产生自己的次级偏置电源，无需隔离的次级电源偏置。还可以根据各种应用需求为外部支持电路供电。支持基于所需输入引脚数量的两种操作模式。两线模式通常用于驱动机械继电器，控制开关只需两个引脚，支持 6.5V 至 48V 的宽电压范围操作","SymbolName":"{\"name\":\"TPSI3052QDWZRQ1\",\"uuid\":\"8266a274f3e0132f\",\"source\":\"\"}","FootprintName":"{\"name\":\"SOIC-8_L7.5-W5.9-P1.27-LS11.5-BL-1\",\"uuid\":\"581f583318e44f39\",\"source\":\"\"}"}}|
